OS_type: unix
SystemRequirements: The managed R-universe binary targets Ubuntu 26.04 x86_64
    (including WSL2 running that distribution). GPU-backed operations require
    a supported NVIDIA GPU and driver 580 or newer. Functional source builds
    require CUDA Toolkit 13.2.2, GNU C++ 14 or newer, RAPIDS cuML and nvForest
    26.06, and Treelite 4.7.0 supplied through a compatible local toolchain or
    the mlverse R-universe build environment.
